\int f\operatorname{div}(\eta_n\bm{\varphi})
=
\int f\eta_n\operatorname{div}(\bm{\varphi})
+
\int f(\mathrm D\eta_n\cdot\bm{\varphi})
\rightarrow
\int f\operatorname{div}(\bm{\varphi})
\]
as $n\rightarrow\infty$, finishing the proof.

